  "translatedBlocks": 32,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7223ef965427ce54",
      "translationZh": "我们非常高兴地宣布，Public AI 现已成为 Hugging Face Hub 支持的推理服务提供商！Public AI 加入了我们不断壮大的生态系统，进一步拓展了直接在 Hub 模型页面上进行无服务器推理的覆盖范围和能力。推理服务提供商也已无缝集成到我们的客户端 SDK（支持 JS 和 Python）中，让你能够轻松通过自己偏好的提供商使用各种模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d61dd2a80041cde",
      "translationZh": "此次上线让你能够直接通过 Hugging Face，以前所未有的便捷方式访问 Swiss AI Initiative 和 AI Singapore 等机构的公共模型和主权模型。你可以在 https://huggingface.co/publicai 浏览 Public AI 在 Hub 上的组织页面，并在 https://huggingface.co/models?inference_provider=publicai&sort=trending 试用当前热门的受支持模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbb37e03d646f292",
      "translationZh": "Public AI Inference Utility 是一个非营利开源项目。该团队开发产品并组织倡导活动，以支持 Swiss AI Initiative 和 AI Singapore 等公共 AI 模型构建者的工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a104f4477fd444f",
      "translationZh": "Public AI Inference Utility 运行在分布式基础设施上，将由 vLLM 驱动的后端与一个部署层相结合，该部署层旨在确保跨多个合作伙伴的运行韧性。在幕后，推理由运行 vLLM 并提供 OpenAI 兼容 API 的服务器处理，这些服务器部署在国家及行业合作伙伴捐赠的集群中。全局负载均衡层确保请求得到高效、透明的路由，无论处理查询的算力来自哪个国家。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a87048653b0e9d69",
      "translationZh": "免费公共访问由捐赠的 GPU 使用时长和广告补贴支持，而长期稳定运行则计划以国家和机构的投入为支柱。你可以在 https://platform.publicai.co/ 进一步了解 Public AI 的平台和基础设施。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36186bb466a156d6",
      "translationZh": "你现在可以在 Hugging Face 上将 Public AI Inference Utility 用作推理服务提供商。我们满怀期待，想看看你会利用这家新提供商构建出什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34bbb8d4da3473ab",
      "translationZh": "有关如何将 Public AI 用作推理服务提供商的更多信息，请阅读其专门的文档页面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5fdfb9af6715394",
      "translationZh": "在此查看受支持模型的列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81081802da8646bb",
      "translationZh": "在网站用户界面中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71d763e2913402e9",
      "translationZh": "在用户账户设置中，你可以：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "acf7bfc5b45f5bdb",
      "translationZh": "为你已注册的提供商设置自己的 API 密钥。如果未设置自定义密钥，你的请求将通过 HF 路由。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d74cb8ea19d4fc72",
      "translationZh": "按偏好对提供商排序。这适用于模型页面中的小组件和代码片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "10dba80cb700cfe7",
      "translationZh": "如前所述，调用 Inference Providers 时有两种模式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "70ad596a5abeea36",
      "translationZh": "自定义密钥（使用你在相应推理提供商处的 API 密钥，直接向该推理提供商发起调用）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43848c3df5d9232d",
      "translationZh": "由 HF 路由（在这种情况下，你不需要提供商的令牌，费用会直接计入你的 HF 账户，而不是你在提供商处的账户）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7ae8780922d4fe1",
      "translationZh": "模型页面会展示第三方推理服务提供商（仅展示与当前模型兼容的提供商，并按用户偏好排序）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be0d888d38854a72",
      "translationZh": "通过客户端 SDK 使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fbb48338870abf08",
      "translationZh": "在 Python 中使用 huggingface_hub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecf74dbdee6a7db3",
      "translationZh": "以下示例展示了如何以 Public AI 为推理服务提供商，使用 Swiss AI 的 Apertus-70B。你可以使用 Hugging Face 令牌，通过 Hugging Face 自动路由请求；如果你有自己的 Public AI API 密钥，也可以使用该密钥。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e034d53fcf76fd5",
      "translationZh": "注意：这需要使用较新版本的 huggingface_hub（>= 0.34.6）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "11a638239fb39f43",
      "translationZh": "在 JS 中使用 @huggingface/inference",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ac8bbca9a74cfbd",
      "translationZh": "计费",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ac1b8c30f0d0c31",
      "translationZh": "截至撰文时，通过 Hugging Face Inference Providers 使用 Public AI Inference Utility 是免费的。定价和可用性可能会发生变化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7da60b548eff32a1",
      "translationZh": "平台上其他提供商的计费方式如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2bf1612b561b3b2",
      "translationZh": "对于直接请求，即使用推理提供商的密钥发起的请求，由相应的提供商向你收费。例如，如果你使用 Public AI API 密钥，费用就会计入你的 Public AI 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6101607d5536134f",
      "translationZh": "对于路由请求，即通过 Hugging Face Hub 进行身份验证的请求，你只需按提供商的标准 API 费率付费。我们不会额外加价，只会直接转收提供商的费用。（未来，我们可能会与提供商合作伙伴达成收入分成协议。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "267e8c36449a9380",
      "translationZh": "重要提示 ‼️ PRO 用户每月可获得价值 $2 的推理额度。这些额度可跨提供商使用。🔥",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e2ea1d08ca3f42b",
      "translationZh": "订阅 Hugging Face PRO 套餐，即可获得推理额度、ZeroGPU、Spaces Dev Mode、提高至 20 倍的限额，以及更多权益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f78dc149c1ec0490",
      "translationZh": "我们也为已登录的免费用户提供少量免费推理额度，但如果条件允许，请升级至 PRO！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c625dbaf508de2f3",
      "translationZh": "反馈与后续计划",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf060e0cea2edb62",
      "translationZh": "我们非常期待收到你的反馈！请在这里分享你的想法和/或评论：https://huggingface.co/spaces/huggingface/HuggingDiscussions/discussions/49",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
